      "text": "Lehi … was a descendant of Joseph, 1 Ne. 5:14 (Alma 10:3). this remnant … is the seed of thy father, 1 Ne. 13:34 (3 Ne. 15:12). are we not a branch of the house of Israel, 1 Ne. 15:12. branch which was to be broken off, 2 Ne. 3:5. Ephraim, Manasseh; they together shall be against Judah, 2 Ne. 19:21. righteous branch from the fruit of the loins of Joseph, Jacob 2:25. we are a remnant of the seed of Joseph, Alma 46:23 (3 Ne. 10:17). this people will I establish in this land, 3 Ne. 20:22. New Jerusalem should be built … unto the remnant of the seed of Joseph, Ether 13:6.",
